# DRC-SP-SUR-1: spacing nwell pdiff 5 surround_ok; pdiff crossing the nwell edge, pdiff 3 outside, pdiff inside.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 30 30
paint nwell
box 25 10 35 15
paint pdiff
box 33 20 38 25
paint pdiff
box 10 10 15 15
paint pdiff
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
